## Fix macOS Control-click multi-select

Context: Chromium on macOS emits pointerdown/mousedown/contextmenu/pointerup/mouseup
for Control-click and never fires click, so the click-only Ctrl/Cmd toggle never
ran. Control-drag on empty SVG started the marquee, then the SVG contextmenu
opened the Canvas menu and interfered. Modifier contextmenu now toggles nodes
and suppresses the Canvas menu; unmodified right-click menus stay unchanged.

Changes:

1. tests/units/front/test_ontology_map_multi_select.py
   Failing-then-green contracts for modifier contextmenu on nodes and SVG.
2. src/front/static/ontology/js/ontology-map.js
   Toggle on modifier node contextmenu; preventDefault/return on modifier SVG
   contextmenu so an active marquee is preserved.

